# NODX Web Showcase {#showcase}

[A compact HTML-oriented showcase.]{.lead}

This document exercises **strong**, *emphasis*, `code`, ==mark==, ~sub~,
^sup^, [safe links](https://example.com), spans with attributes, variables
like {{vars.release}}, and stable references such as @[feature-table].

## Navigation And Tables {#navigation}

| Feature | Covered |
| - | - |
| Front matter and profiles | yes |
| Canonical AST and NCP IDs | yes |
| Safe HTML rendering | yes |
| Tables and inline syntax | yes |

:::note {#web-note type="info"}
Renderers may style this note, but unsupported renderers still expose the child
paragraph as ordinary document content.
:::

